<title>ITALY: San Paolo to reopen Moscow office.</title>
<headline>San Paolo to reopen Moscow office.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's largest banking group San Paolo di Torino said in a statement that it was re-opening its representative office in Moscow and also preparing to open an office in Warsaw, Poland.</p>
<p>The Moscow office was first opened in the spring of 1989 but has been closed since 1994. It has been reopened due to interest in the Russian market, San Paolo added.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
